    "schedule.preview_workers_most_default_other": "Assumed: {{count}} workers per position where the bill gives no crew ({{positions}} positions), the most the plan assumes. Even so the work runs past a default window of {{days}} days. Check the labour hours in the bill, or enter an end date and more workers.",
